## What this page will show

This record follows the same structure as every action on this site: the context, what the Foundation did, who was supported, photographs and documents, partners and delivery details, and the confirmed result.

CMAX Foundation's previous website stated that 100% of public donations were being used to develop units for Ukraine. The Foundation is confirming the delivery details, the receiving institutions and the photographic record before publishing them here, so that what appears on this page can be verified.

## Support the next emergency response

Contributions marked for Ukraine are reserved for that purpose. You can also ask how to support medical response capacity in the next emergency through the form below.
